</div>          </div>          <div n="1" type="jPoliticalNews">             <div n="2" type="jArticle" xml:id="a2b" prev="#a2a" next="#a2c">                <p>Hau&#x017F;e noch einmal zur Kenntniß gebracht werde.<lb/>
